    "title": "\"Unruly\" flight passenger pleads guilty to federal charges - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Iowa's News Now Staff ,\n6 hours ago CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa — The Nebraska man who allegedly caused a flight to divert to the Eastern Iowa Airport by being \"unruly\" has plead guilty to his charges. Mario Nikprelaj submitted a guilty plea on Sept. 23 in federal courts. The courts accepted his plea on Wednesday, Oct. 8. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
